| Instance Name | Resource | Clock Region | Clock Source | Reference Clock | Feedback Mode | Feedback Clock | Clkout0 | Clkout1 | Clkout2 |
+---------------+----------+--------------+--------------+-----------------+---------------+----------------+---------+---------+---------+
|     CLOCK     | PLL_BR0  |      B       |   external   |      CLKIN      |      core     |      clk       |   clk   |  clkex  |         |
+---------------+----------+--------------+--------------+-----------------+---------------+----------------+---------+---------+---------+

Instance Name                 : CLOCK
Resource                      : PLL_BR0
Clock Source                  : external
Reference Clock Resource      : GPIOR_186
Reference Clock               : CLKIN
Feedback Mode                 : core
Feedback Clock                : clk

Reference Clock Frequency     : 50.0000 MHz
Reference Clock Period        : 20.0000 ns
Multiplier (M)                : 5
Pre-Divider (N)               : 2
VCO Frequency                 : 3000.0000 MHz
Post-Divider (O)              : 4
PLL Frequency                 : 750.0000 MHz

Output Clock 0
Clock Pin Name                : clk
Output Divider                : 6
Output Phase Shift            : 0
Output Frequency              : 125.0000 MHz
Output Period                 : 8.0000 ns

Output Clock 1
Clock Pin Name                : clkex
Output Divider                : 6
Output Phase Shift            : 90
Output Frequency              : 125.0000 MHz
Output Period                 : 8.0000 ns

Frequency calculations:
	VCO = REFCLK * ((M * FBK) /N)
	    = 50.0000 MHz * ((5*24) /2)
	    = 3000.0000 MHz
	PLL = VCO / O
	    = 3000.0000 MHz / 4
	    = 750.0000 MHz

	CLKOUT0 = PLL / CLKOUT0_DIV
	        = 750.0000 MHz / 6
	        = 125.0000 MHz
	CLKOUT1 = PLL / CLKOUT1_DIV
	        = 750.0000 MHz / 6
	        = 125.0000 MHz

SDC Constraints:
	create_clock -period 8.0000 clk
	create_clock -waveform {2.0000 6.0000} -period 8.0000 clkex

